<title>UK: House of Fraser to cut 1,000 jobs - paper.</title>
<headline>House of Fraser to cut 1,000 jobs - paper.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>House of Fraser will cut more than 1,000 jobs as it closes 10 of its 50 stores, according to The Sunday Times newspaper.</p>
<p>The stores group, due to report its results for the first half on Tuesday, is expected to announce a restructuring charge of at least 30 million stg to be taken within the next year, the paper said.</p>
<p>House of Fraser was not immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>The company's shares closed at 162p on Friday.</p>
<p>--London newsroom +44 171 542 4027</p>
